            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://fedora-commons.svn.sourceforge.net/viewvc/fedora-commons/fedora/branches/dev-146791/),",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " there is initial support for exporting Fedora objects as IMS Content Packages (which, to my understanding, is very close to SCORM). Ingest (import) is not yet supported however.",
